    "generateNpcChatSummary": {
      "Summary Guidance": "## SPACEFLEET CHAT MEMORY\n- Preserve durable social/operational facts: promises, refusals, bargains, warnings, permissions, access decisions, orders acknowledged or disputed, rendezvous arrangements, owed answers, secrets revealed, lies/corrections, insults/apologies, flirtation, address/rank changes and trust boundaries.\n- Record the information channel: direct conversation, intercom, radio/vox, data link, message, sensor report or hearsay when it matters.\n- Preserve what the NPC learned or believes, not omniscient registry truth. Detached-vessel location, damage, cargo or orders remain unknown unless this chat actually conveyed them.\n- Do not duplicate mechanical registry state as chat memory unless the conversation changed what this NPC knows, promised or agreed to.",
